# URSB template placeholder — kept because scripts/validate-project.sh checks for it.
#
# Amanahku is a Laravel app, so the real templates are the Laravel-canonical ones:
#   .env.example             → local development (copy to .env, then `php artisan key:generate`)
#   .env.staging.example     → amanahku-staging.myappsonline.net
#   .env.production.example  → production (not provisioned yet)
#
# Never commit `.env`. Real secrets live in the secrets manager / CI variables.
# Do NOT put Restricted data here. See security/README.md and
# engineering-standard/security/data-classification.md.
